# ============================================================
# .env.example — API keys untuk opencode
# ============================================================
# Cara pakai:
#   1. Salin file ini menjadi ".env"  (jangan commit .env ke git)
#   2. Isi nilai API key sesuai provider yang kamu pakai
#   3. Jalankan opencode lewat script:  .\launch-opencode.ps1
#   4. Di opencode.jsonc, ganti nilai apiKey literal menjadi
#      "{env:NAMA_VARIABEL}" sesuai nama di bawah.
#
# Catatan: opencode TIDAK membaca .env otomatis. Script
# launch-opencode.ps1 yang memuat variabel ini ke environment.
# ============================================================

# --- Anthropic (Claude) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxx

# --- OpenAI ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxx

# --- Google Gemini ---
# GEMINI_API_KEY=xxxx

# --- OpenRouter ---
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-xxxx

# --- xAI (Grok) ---
# XAI_API_KEY=xai-xxxx

# --- Groq ---
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_xxxx

# --- DeepSeek ---
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-xxxx

# --- GitHub Copilot (jika pakai auth github) ---
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxx

# --- Custom / provider lain ---
# Tambahkan variabel sendiri sesuai provider di opencode.jsonc,
# lalu pakai {env:NAMA_VARIABEL} pada bagian options.apiKey.
